+        2 * integral from 0 to sqrt(b) of cos(t*u**2) du.
+
+    The smooth integral is evaluated with composite 16-point Gauss-Legendre
+    quadrature.  Panels are kept short enough that the phase changes by at
+    most pi/4 across a panel, which resolves the oscillations for large t*b.
